# {{.ProjectName}}

NestJS monolith with layered architecture.

## Stack

- **Language:** TypeScript
- **Framework:** NestJS
- **ORM:** Prisma
- **Database:** SQLite (default)

## Quick Start

```bash
npm install
npx prisma db push
npm run start:dev
```

## Endpoints

- `POST /api/items` — Create an item
- `GET  /api/items/:id` — Get item by ID
